cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MESSI in research, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "MESSI: A Multi-Agent Environment for Soccer Simulation and Intelligence"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-07
repository-code: "https://github.com/UoS-CIDA-Lab/MESSI"
authors:
  - family-names: Park
    given-names: Hyunwoo
    affiliation: "CIDA Lab, University of Seoul"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  MESSI is a JAX-native multi-agent football environment for full 90-minute
  11-vs-11 simulation, imitation learning, multi-agent reinforcement learning,
  and reproducible football research. Formerly published as SoccerWorld.
